step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a robust but different strategy – median over pool3 to see if median beats mean on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a single strong model that performed best in some window – ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test the best single model ONLY_DWT_rf to see if a single strong model beats the median pool3 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_DWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a robust median on pool2 to see if a different pool improves over median pool3.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves over the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool3 to see if a different deterministic aggregation improves on median pool3.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the smallest pool (pool1) to see if fewer models improve stability.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool2 to see if a different deterministic aggregation improves on median pool3.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the best single ETS model to see if a single strong model beats the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on ARIMA to see if a different single model improves over the median pool3 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination using inverse-error weights on the full pool to see if that beats the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ONLY_DWT_rf","ETS","THETA","CWT_rf","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‐mean over pool4 to see if trimming reduces noise and improves over the current best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if expanding the pool improves over the current best single ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

